Maintainer: CPZeroOS <15324879+therezor@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: cpzeroos-base, openssh-server, avahi-daemon, sudo, less, strace, usbutils, evtest, iw
Description: CPZeroOS developer settings (never in a release)
 SSH on, avahi so the device answers to its .local name, sudo without a
 password, a persistent journal, radios unblocked at boot, and a few
 debugging tools. A release build fails if this package is in it.
